# id|label|repo|ref|description. repo is a git URL or path relative to project root starting with '/'.
# ref is a git tag or branch, or "-" for the default branch; ignored for local directories.
# Each source must have install.sh at its root. Ids must be unique across desktops.list.

# DEs
cosmic|Cosmic (Trixie)|/cosmic|-|Unofficial JustAGuyLinux Trixie build of System76's Gnome-inspired Desktop
cinnamon|Cinnamon|/cinnamon|-|Traditional layout, familiar to Windows users
gnome|GNOME|/gnome|-|Modern, polished, Wayland-first desktop
lxqt|LXQt|/lxqt|-|Very lightweight Qt desktop
kde|KDE Plasma|/kde|-|Highly configurable, feature-rich desktop
mate|MATE|/mate|-|Lightweight GNOME 2 successor
xfce|Xfce|/xfce|-|Lightweight traditional desktop

## WMs
hyprland|Hyprland|/hyprland|-|Dynamic tiling Wayland compositor (backport)
i3|i3|/i3|-|Tiling X11 window manager
openbox|Openbox|/openbox|-|Stacking window manager, minimal
sway|Sway|/sway|-|Tiling Wayland compositor, i3-compatible
